'''Flynn''' is a male [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found near the [[Snowhill Stage]] located in [[Snowhill]]. He appears to be the Snowhill Stage caretaker.

==Trivia==
*Flynn was introduced upon the launch of ''[[Free Realms]]'' in April 2009, during the time [[Bruce]] performed on the Snowhill Stage.
